From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|maki}}, from {{inh|sv|non|maki}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*makô}}. Doublet of {{m|sv|maka}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sv|/ˈmɑːˌkɛ/}}
* {{audio|sv|Sv-make.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{sv-noun|c}}

# {{lb|sv|slightly|archaistic|or|formal}} a [[spouse]], a [[husband]], a married [[man]] (mostly referring to a specific relation)
#: {{syn|sv|man}}
#: {{ux|sv|Hon hade inte sett sin '''make''' på hela dagen.|She had not seen her '''husband''' all day.}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''Makarna''' hade råkat ta in på samma hotell.|'''The man and his wife''' happened to board at the same hotel.}}
# something alike, [[likes]]
#: {{ux|sv|Restaurangen serverade sillrätter jag aldrig sett '''maken till'''|The restaurant served herring dishes I've never seen '''the likes of'''}}
#: {{ux|sv|Ingen hade sett svärdets '''make'''|Nobody had seen a sword '''like''' this}}

